# Repository Context Loading

Context loading is **not optional**. Before any work:

1. Read `CONTEXT.md`
2. Read `AGENTS.md`
3. Read mandatory `docs/` listed in CONTEXT.md (GOVERNANCE, ARCHITECTURE, TESTING, COMMENTS, DEPENDENCIES, SECURITY, CI_CD, ENVIRONMENTS, DEPLOYMENT; REVIEW when reviewing)

## MUST

- [ ] Follow source-of-truth precedence in CONTEXT.md
- [ ] Respect non-negotiable constraints (strict TS, no secrets, history/message limits, Claude → 502, no full-event logging)
- [ ] Run `make preflight` before claiming work is done

## MUST NOT

- Skip context loading
- Selectively ignore governance because the task “seems small”
- Commit `.env`, secrets, or widen CORS to `*`
